            kill: "yes",
            id: "Konrad",
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:store_unit",
            variable: "delfador_store",
            kill: "yes",
            id: "Delfador",
          },
        ],
      },
      {
        tag: "event",
        id: "ev_6",
        on: "start",
        once: true,
        children: [
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:play_sound",
            file: "ambient/ship.ogg",
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:add_item",
            x: 31,
            y: 11,
            item_name: "",
            image: "scenery%2Fgalleon.png~RC(magenta%3Ered)",
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:unstore_unit",
            variable: "konrad_store",
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:unstore_unit",
            variable: "delfador_store",
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "narrator",
            portrait: "wesnoth-icon.png",
            text: _("And so the party landed on the Isle of Alduin."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Konrad",
            text: _("So this is Alduin. It looks a little... desolate."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Usadar Q'kai",
            text: _("Who is that? Oh, a party of elves has landed. We shall drive them back into the sea!"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Delfador",
            text: _("If the orcs have come here, their forces at Elensefar must be even more numerous than I feared."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Delfador",
            text: _("Konrad, training is important. If we only have inexperienced troops when we reach Elensefar, then our journey is likely to end in sight of the city’s gates."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Delfador",
            text: _("This island is the place where I was born, and where I learned magic; it used to be so beautiful. We must recapture it! To arms!"),
          },
        ],
      },
      {
        tag: "event",
        id: "ev_7",
        on: "moveto",
        once: true,
        children: [
          {
            tag: "filter",
            side: 1,
            x: 20,
            y: 9,
          },
          {
            tag: "spawn",
            id: "Elrian",
            type: "Mage",
            side: 1,
            x: 19,
            y: 8,
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:spawn_unit",
            unit: "Elrian",
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:make_loyal",
            unit: "Elrian",
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            text: _("I found someone hiding in the village!"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Elrian",
            text: _("My lords, I have been hiding in the village from the orcs, like many of the other magi here. I pledge myself to your service; let us move swiftly to recapture the island!"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Delfador",
            text: _("Certainly, let us join together to fight the evil ones."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "narrator",
            portrait: "wesnoth-icon.png",
            text: _("You can now recruit magi!"),
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:config_recruit",
            side: 1,
            mode: "allow",
            types: "Mage",
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:set_variable_dynamic",
            variable: "received_mages",
            value: "yes",
            mode: "value",
          },
        ],
      },
      {
        tag: "event",
        id: "if_9",
        on: "branch_if_9",
        once: true,
        children: [
          {
            tag: "condition",
            variable: "received_mages",
            not_equals: "yes",
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "narrator",
            portrait: "wesnoth-icon.png",
            text: _("You can now recruit magi!"),
          },
        ],
      },
      {
        tag: "event",
        id: "ev_8",
        on: "enemies_defeated",
        once: true,
        children: [
          {
            tag: "spawn",
            id: "Seimus",
            type: "Arch Mage",
            side: 1,
            x: 5,
            y: 34,
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:spawn_unit",
            unit: "Seimus",
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:make_loyal",
            unit: "Seimus",
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:delay",
            time: 1250,
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Seimus",
            text: _("Delfador, my old master! You have saved the island from the orcs!"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Delfador",
            text: _("My apprentice! How did the island fall to such as these?"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Seimus",
            text: _("You have not heard, master Delfador? Asheviere is trying to control the entire western coast. She hired many orcs and sent them here. They were holding me until a ship could arrive to take me to Weldyn where I am to stand trial for treason for training magi!"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Delfador",
            text: _("We have come from fighting her forces at Blackwater. Where else has she attacked?"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Seimus",
            text: _("She has taken control of the Bay of Pearls, long held by the mer, and has turned them into slaves. There they dive for pearls by which she grows richer every day. There are even rumors that she may break the ancient treaty and attack Elensefar!"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Konrad",
            text: _("Can’t we strike back at her? How many forces does she have at the Bay of Pearls? Can we take it back from her?"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Delfador",
            text: _("We must indeed go there. Let us therefore rest here a little, and then set sail for the Bay. Hopefully we will defeat her forces there!"),
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:fire_event",
            event: "branch_if_9",
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:kill_unit",
            unit: "Seimus",
          },
          {
            tag: "win",
          },
        ],
      },
      {
        tag: "event",
        id: "ev_10",
        on: "last_breath",
        once: true,
        children: [
          {
            tag: "filter_condition",
            children: [
              {
                tag: "predicate",
                name: "wml_filter",
                unit: "$last_dead_id",
                filter: "%7B%22tag%22%3A%22filter%22%2C%22attributes%22%3A%7B%22id%22%3A%22Konrad%22%7D%2C%22children%22%3A%5B%5D%7D",
              },
            ],
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            text: _("We are vanquished, for I have been defeated!"),
          },
          {
            tag: "lose",
          },
        ],
      },
      {
        tag: "event",
        id: "ev_11",
        on: "last_breath",
        once: true,
        children: [
          {
            tag: "filter_condition",
            children: [
              {
                tag: "predicate",
                name: "wml_filter",
                unit: "$last_dead_id",
                filter: "%7B%22tag%22%3A%22filter%22%2C%22attributes%22%3A%7B%22id%22%3A%22Li'sar%22%2C%22side%22%3A%221%22%7D%2C%22children%22%3A%5B%5D%7D",
              },
            ],
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            text: _("I can’t believe it should end like this!"),
          },
          {
            tag: "lose",
          },
        ],
      },
      {
        tag: "event",
        id: "ev_12",
        on: "last_breath",
